# docs/ — ignore everything new at the top level by default. Existing tracked
# files and subdirectories are whitelisted below. To track a NEW top-level
# file under docs/, add an explicit `!docs/<name>` line here AND `git add -f`.
# Subdirectories already whitelisted (adr/, algo_calcul_simu/, audits/, olds/,
# qa-reports/, runbooks/, superpowers/) accept new files freely.
